{"prefectureId":"14","cities":{"14101":[{"id":"14101:national:77ba0a463a2c","cityId":"14101","category":"地域","text":"鶴見区は、横浜市の最東端に位置し、東京湾に面する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B6%B4%E8%A6%8B%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%A8%AA%E6%B5%9C%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=109697470"},{"id":"14101:national:9b0ff5059b2d","cityId":"14101","category":"地域","text":"区内北西部には自然が残り、獅子ケ谷市民の森、神奈川県立三ツ池公園などがあります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B6%B4%E8%A6%8B%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%A8%AA%E6%B5%9C%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=109697470"}],"14102":[{"id":"14102:national:176d4834780d","cityId":"14102","category":"地理・自然","text":"横浜市神奈川区は横浜市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%88%E5%B7%9D%E5%8C%BA&oldid=110893113"}],"14103":[{"id":"14103:national:64cf10324d16","cityId":"14103","category":"地域","text":"区の東部は東京湾に面しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%A5%BF%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%A8%AA%E6%B5%9C%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=111149464"}],"14104":[{"id":"14104:national:815ce29dacdc","cityId":"14104","category":"地理・自然","text":"横浜市中区は横浜市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%A8%AA%E6%B5%9C%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=110893823"}],"14105":[{"id":"14105:national:172552070864","cityId":"14105","category":"文化・名所","text":"南区内の大岡川沿いには約500本の桜があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%A8%AA%E6%B5%9C%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=109870932"}],"14106":[{"id":"14106:national:3b95723d14c2","cityId":"14106","category":"地理・自然","text":"横浜市保土ケ谷区は横浜市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BF%9D%E5%9C%9F%E3%82%B1%E8%B0%B7%E5%8C%BA&oldid=111315190"}],"14107":[{"id":"14107:national:f4093a24649e","cityId":"14107","category":"歴史","text":"磯子区のほかは、鶴見区、神奈川区、中区、保土ケ谷区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%A3%AF%E5%AD%90%E5%8C%BA&oldid=110721656"},{"id":"14107:national:93fee310b799","cityId":"14107","category":"地域","text":"区内の大部分は宅地化されているが、南部の円海山周辺